244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Read-a-story Program: Under the aegis of n+1, a not-for-profit organization dedicated to education, we work with under-served and disadvantaged students, primarily from the rural interiors of Maharashtra, India. Our initiative focuses on teaching English remotely over the phone and the internet, leveraging a network of dedicated volunteers. The project is currently active across various districts in Maharashtra, and we anticipate expanding the program in Gujarat.  Last year, the Bala Mandir Kamraj Trust took over this project in Tamil Nadu.)
/E (Read-a-story Program: Under the aegis of n+1, a not-for-profit organization dedicated to education, we work with under-served and disadvantaged students, primarily from the rural interiors of Maharashtra, India. Our initiative focuses on teaching English remotely over the phone and the internet, leveraging a network of dedicated volunteers. The project is currently active across various districts in Maharashtra, and we anticipate expanding the program in Gujarat.  Last year, the Bala Mandir Kamraj Trust took over this project in Tamil Nadu.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
