/T (Gram Seva Trust, founded by Dr. Ashwinbhai Shah and Dr. Harshaben Shah in 1994, has been a beacon of hope and service in South Gujarat, particularly benefiting the tribal communities of Navsari, Surat, & the Dang districts. With a foundation built on transparency, good governance, simplicity, & accountability, the trust has successfully completed 25 years of impactful service.)
