/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (In collaboration with Gram Seva Trust, Read-a-story launched a pilot batch in Gujarat, aiming to leverage technology, the internet, & a personal touch to extend the program's reach. Volunteers with basic proficiency in Gujarati or Hindi were invited to join this meaningful mission, focused on helping tribal children enhance their English literacy & educational prospects. The sessions were held every Tuesday & Thursday via Google Meet, with 22 students & 10 volunteers participating. Students were divided into pairs or small groups of two or three. The pilot program was a success, resulting in a significant improvement in the students' English reading skills as 100% of the students went at least one level up.)
/E (In collaboration with Gram Seva Trust, Read-a-story launched a pilot batch in Gujarat, aiming to leverage technology, the internet, & a personal touch to extend the program's reach. Volunteers with basic proficiency in Gujarati or Hindi were invited to join this meaningful mission, focused on helping tribal children enhance their English literacy & educational prospects. The sessions were held every Tuesday & Thursday via Google Meet, with 22 students & 10 volunteers participating. Students were divided into pairs or small groups of two or three. The pilot program was a success, resulting in a significant improvement in the students' English reading skills as 100% of the students went at least one level up.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
