/T (In the small village of Adgaon, located in the Konkan region, an innovative internet-based education program has been successfully launched for local students. Before the regular school day begins, 64 students attend online classes in two batches at the school. These sessions facilitated through Google Meet, connect 2-3 students with volunteers for interactive, personalized learning. Thanks to the generosity of Mr. Chetan Patwardhan, who has provided essential infrastructure, including fiber-optic internet, laptops, & tablets, the program could be implimented. He has also appointed a local coordinator to ensure seamless operations. This initiative has significantly enhanced educational access, leading to a 64% improvement in learning outcomes.)
/E (In the small village of Adgaon, located in the Konkan region, an innovative internet-based education program has been successfully launched for local students. Before the regular school day begins, 64 students attend online classes in two batches at the school. These sessions facilitated through Google Meet, connect 2-3 students with volunteers for interactive, personalized learning. Thanks to the generosity of Mr. Chetan Patwardhan, who has provided essential infrastructure, including fiber-optic internet, laptops, & tablets, the program could be implimented. He has also appointed a local coordinator to ensure seamless operations. This initiative has significantly enhanced educational access, leading to a 64% improvement in learning outcomes.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
304 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (However, some challenges have emerged, such as changes in school management, increased student absenteeism, & the need for more engagement with school authorities & parents to restore attendance levels. Additionally, there remains a lack of awareness about the importance of education, so making ongoing efforts with parents is essential to shift their mindset & prioritize their children's education.)
/E (However, some challenges have emerged, such as changes in school management, increased student absenteeism, & the need for more engagement with school authorities & parents to restore attendance levels. Additionally, there remains a lack of awareness about the importance of education, so making ongoing efforts with parents is essential to shift their mindset & prioritize their children's education.)
