/E (The program aims to break this cycle by providing tailored educational support and empowering these young learners with the skills they need to improve their reading proficiency. By focusing on English, a subject often perceived as a gateway to broader opportunities, SPMESM and RAS are helping these students gain confidence, enabling them to pursue further academic and professional success.)
