/T (The Read-a-Story \(RAS\) initiative actively recruits volunteers from diverse educational backgrounds across India. This collaboration creates a mutually enriching experience, benefiting both RAS students in rural areas and urban volunteers. For many city-based participants with limited exposure to village life, involvement in RAS raises awareness of the challenges faced by a significant portion of our population, fostering empathy and deeper understanding.)
