447 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (I have been associated with Read a story for about 2 years now. It started with interacting with the students over the phone. I will never forget the 7 am classes with Kartik, a 5th grader, who wouldn't even have had his tea or breakfast but had all the enthusiasm to read and learn English. When I asked, Kartik what he wanted to be when he grew up, he spontaneously replied that he just wanted to speak good English! I just hope I was able to help him achieve this. I am truly grateful that I got the opportunity to interact and teach these students.)
/E (I have been associated with Read a story for about 2 years now. It started with interacting with the students over the phone. I will never forget the 7 am classes with Kartik, a 5th grader, who wouldn't even have had his tea or breakfast but had all the enthusiasm to read and learn English. When I asked, Kartik what he wanted to be when he grew up, he spontaneously replied that he just wanted to speak good English! I just hope I was able to help him achieve this. I am truly grateful that I got the opportunity to interact and teach these students.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
448 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Ahaan Mashruwala)
/E (Ahaan Mashruwala)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
449 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Working as a volunteer at n+1 Read-a-story has been incredibly fulfilling. I found the flyer circulated over 7 months ago, and I'm proud to say I have been a part ever since. This opportunity to empower young minds and help them learn has made me a better teacher and learner. Being still in school, I am able to appreciate the importance of good education, and this allows me to help others close to my age gain access to it as well. The team at n+1 is always ready to help, support, and guide me throughout this teaching journey of mine and the learning journey of the children I teach. Truly grateful!)
/E (Working as a volunteer at n+1 Read-a-story has been incredibly fulfilling. I found the flyer circulated over 7 months ago, and I'm proud to say I have been a part ever since. This opportunity to empower young minds and help them learn has made me a better teacher and learner. Being still in school, I am able to appreciate the importance of good education, and this allows me to help others close to my age gain access to it as well. The team at n+1 is always ready to help, support, and guide me throughout this teaching journey of mine and the learning journey of the children I teach. Truly grateful!)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
