/T (Being a volunteer for Read-a-story has been an extremely rewarding experience. Coming from a family that emphasizes on education and strongly believes in sharing knowledge, Read-A-story has given me the rewarding experience of teaching children English. By helping students who aren't very privileged gives me a sense of fulfillment and happiness, and I am so glad that through Read-a-story I am able to give back to society. Apart from this, the staff is extremely supportive. They help you out whenever you run into troubles and provide all the instructions and resources very well, making the teaching experience easier.)
