/T (Foundational Numeracy - Mathematics poses a significant challenge for rural tribal students, who often struggle due to limited practice and access to qualified teachers. Weak foundational skills make it hard for them to grasp more complex topics, leading to disinterest and higher dropout rates. Our program addresses this by using technology to scale while ensuring personalized attention to keep students engaged and motivated. This program is active in Palghar district of Maharashtra. )
/E (Foundational Numeracy - Mathematics poses a significant challenge for rural tribal students, who often struggle due to limited practice and access to qualified teachers. Weak foundational skills make it hard for them to grasp more complex topics, leading to disinterest and higher dropout rates. Our program addresses this by using technology to scale while ensuring personalized attention to keep students engaged and motivated. This program is active in Palghar district of Maharashtra. )
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
