/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Read-a-story and the Foundational Numeracy programs have made remarkable progress in empowering rural and tribal students with essential skills. In English literacy, the Read-a-story program now supports over 1,000 students across Maharshtra, offering personalized English tutoring through a blend of technology and human interaction.)
/E (Read-a-story and the Foundational Numeracy programs have made remarkable progress in empowering rural and tribal students with essential skills. In English literacy, the Read-a-story program now supports over 1,000 students across Maharshtra, offering personalized English tutoring through a blend of technology and human interaction.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
588 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Foundational Numeracy initiative is tackling critical gaps in basic math skills within Zilla Parishad schools. Supported by community facilitators and a custom math practice app, the program is helping over 2,000 students strengthen their numeracy skills. To ensure impact and continuous improvement, Indian Institute of Technology-Bombay \(IIT-B\) is conducting the monitoring and evaluation of the program. Both initiatives reflect our commitment to building a strong educational foundation, equipping young learners for long-term academic success.)
/E (The Foundational Numeracy initiative is tackling critical gaps in basic math skills within Zilla Parishad schools. Supported by community facilitators and a custom math practice app, the program is helping over 2,000 students strengthen their numeracy skills. To ensure impact and continuous improvement, Indian Institute of Technology-Bombay \(IIT-B\) is conducting the monitoring and evaluation of the program. Both initiatives reflect our commitment to building a strong educational foundation, equipping young learners for long-term academic success.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [5]
>>
