/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Read-a-story and Foundational Numeracy are poised for further expansion and impact as we look to the future. Our goal is to reach even more students in rural and tribal areas, scaling our English literacy and Math programs to ensure that every child, regardless of their background, has access to quality education.)
/E (Read-a-story and Foundational Numeracy are poised for further expansion and impact as we look to the future. Our goal is to reach even more students in rural and tribal areas, scaling our English literacy and Math programs to ensure that every child, regardless of their background, has access to quality education.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
591 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (We plan to introduce more interactive learning tools for Read-a-story, expand our volunteer network, and implement additional reading programs in underserved regions. In the Foundational Numeracy program, we aim to deepen our engagement in Talasari and other areas by enhancing our math practice app, increasing community involvement, and collaborating with more educational institutions to ensure continued improvement in basic numeracy.)
/E (We plan to introduce more interactive learning tools for Read-a-story, expand our volunteer network, and implement additional reading programs in underserved regions. In the Foundational Numeracy program, we aim to deepen our engagement in Talasari and other areas by enhancing our math practice app, increasing community involvement, and collaborating with more educational institutions to ensure continued improvement in basic numeracy.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [2]
