/T (We want to take this opportunity to express our deep appreciation to our funders. Their financial support and shared belief in our mission has enabled us to create impactful educational experiences for over 1,600 volunteers and more than 1,000 students. Thanks to their commitment, our programs have grown, providing enriching and transformative opportunities for both students and volunteers alike. We extend our heartfelt thanks once again and look forward to many more years of fruitful collaboration and continued growth.)
